 baume australien multi-usage qui a conquis le monde\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Notre avis sur le 101 Ointment de Lanolips. Baume a la lanoline multi-usage : levres, visage, corps, cheveux, cuticules. L'histoire derriere ce best-seller australien.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"datePublished\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-03-29\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"dateModified\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-03-29\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"image\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/images/articles/lanolips-101-ointment-baume-multi-usage-avis-2026.svg\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"WebPage\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"@id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/article/lanolips-101-ointment-baume-multi-usage-avis-2026\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"author\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Organization\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Bons Plans Mania\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"publisher\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Organization\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Bons Plans Mania\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"logo\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ImageObject\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/icon.svg\\\\\\\"}}}\\\"}}],null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",null,{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"itemListElement\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\":1,\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Accueil\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\":2,\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Beauté\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/categorie/beaute\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\":3,\\\\